{
  "_file": "damned_waters/game/data/rooms/beurs_zaal.json \u2014 RoomSpec for Beurs van Berlage (the city, district 6: Damrak): the exchange hall of the Beurs van Berlage: brick arcades down both sides with the gallery over them, the steel and glass of the roof, night through it. The army made it a mortuary: body bags in rows down the floor, some on trestles, the registration's tables by the gate, work lights on tripods. Not all of the bags are full. Its front wall is the street's shopfront (\"facade\": the street builds it); its door is the street's. Every business name is made up. Single source of truth for Blender (render) and the engine (collision, cameras, things).",
